2 **consumer-side** DEV adapter on original [Draft #634](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/634) exact HEAD `087fe095a87594505392262da1d341cf0c65b2b2`. S50 source producer is [Draft #645](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/645) / #627; not copied or modified. **No** native S49 Action issuer, S16/Goal/WAIT owner, M/P1/L8/L0/L1/L2 modification; no main merge or new World.\n\nNew `adapters/mineflayer/self_body_s50_motion_companion.py` preserves the already-built `SelfBodyView` by identity and accepts an upstream S50 producer-reviewed diagnostic dict with eight exact Paper callback samples and bounded Node source receipts, original source SHA, and zero authority ceiling. **Requires an existing original S16 executed OUTCOME and action-associated original native Present matching the same Action, session and consequence**; S50 data alone cannot mint these. Missing/foreign/malformed/overpromoted sources fail closed. Returns only separate frozen `SelfBodyS50MotionCompanion`, sampled-position-change versus sampled-zero delta and small read-only cognitive summary. No physical stability attestation, full-tick input idle, effective clear tick, Goal/P1/L8/L10 or grant.\n\nIncludes `tests/test_self_body_s50_motion_companion.py` with original SelfBody owner typed inputs and fail-closed negatives; focused GitHub Actions CI and [contract](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/blob/dev/selfbody-s50-motion-companion-20261031/docs/selfbody-s50-motion-companion-dev-20261031.md).\n\n**Actual physical source**: S50 [#645](https://github.com/rinsakamo/relay-self/pull/645) replayed archived Paper World #643 and detected sampled input-OFF motion at tick251 and 252. This consumer branch is **offline**, and the archived S49 Action after-probe is **not** automatically a typed, correlated SelfBody Present; do not call this a deployed host cognition epoch. Subsequent #632 opt-in to provide genuine native typed S16/Present is separate.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_l